(7441289, 1176600, 156466, '<td valign="top">I like the shot. But for the challenge this seems more "natural light" or even "back light" than "window light". It also looks like you worked hard to balance shadows and window light than simply featuring the glow coming from/thru the windows.  Almost indoor HDR-ish.</td>', 'I like the shot. But for the challenge this seems more "natural light" or even "back light" than "window light". It also looks like you worked hard to balance shadows and window light than simply featuring the glow coming from/thru the windows.  Almost indoor HDR-ish.', '2016-03-06 13:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
