(7441653, 1176600, 180331, '<td valign="top">My first ribbon ! Thank you for your great comments. <br/> <br/>The picture is from a guitar concert at a music school for children in the Village Nordfjordeid in Norway.  In addition to the window visible in the picture there are another two windows behind the guitar players that brings out the light. <br/> <br/>To better amplify the reflection in the piano I have adjusted the dark colors in the picture, and the reflection shows chidren behind the door, listening to the music. <br/> <br/></td>', 'My first ribbon ! Thank you for your great comments.  The picture is from a guitar concert at a music school for children in the Village Nordfjordeid in Norway.  In addition to the window visible in the picture there are another two windows behind the guitar players that brings out the light.  To better amplify the reflection in the piano I have adjusted the dark colors in the picture, and the reflection shows chidren behind the door, listening to the music.  ', '2016-03-07 04:27:57.000000', NULL, 0),
