(7441669, 1176708, 59029, '<td valign="top">Huge congrats on the blue!</td>', 'Huge congrats on the blue!', '2016-03-07 09:06:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7441670, 1176708, 124815, '<td valign="top">Ah, interesting comment and explanation about the small space. It was 8 from me and, what happens to me always with good pictures I look at them a lot longer and with a much more critical eye . In context it should have been a 10 cum laude. Does not seem too democratic but one always stops in a museum for longer looks or go faster.<br/>I think that because of the advanced editing you should have gone drastic about the cropping, cut the toe, rotate a bit to the right and have her left hand go high, or crop her right hand that is less expressive and clear<br/>Her posture and left hand and dress are so wonderful, the streaming light so perfect, some dust, the angle formed by the ceiling in a perfect place ... that it might be enough to crop her entire right arm, dress and toe (the shadow to appear might be too much and take the focus on the light).<br/>A blue ribbon yes.<br/>And for yourself you might tweak it since it''s a fabulous image.</td>', 'Ah, interesting comment and explanation about the small space. It was 8 from me and, what happens to me always with good pictures I look at them a lot longer and with a much more critical eye . In context it should have been a 10 cum laude. Does not seem too democratic but one always stops in a museum for longer looks or go faster.I think that because of the advanced editing you should have gone drastic about the cropping, cut the toe, rotate a bit to the right and have her left hand go high, or crop her right hand that is less expressive and clearHer posture and left hand and dress are so wonderful, the streaming light so perfect, some dust, the angle formed by the ceiling in a perfect place ... that it might be enough to crop her entire right arm, dress and toe (the shadow to appear might be too much and take the focus on the light).A blue ribbon yes.And for yourself you might tweak it since it''s a fabulous image.', '2016-03-07 09:16:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7441671, 1176739, 124815, '<td valign="top">Not to be contrarian but for me the quality of this image is given by the space above the sitter''s head. This somber space gives it some power and takes the image into another realm then just a portrait.</td>', 'Not to be contrarian but for me the quality of this image is given by the space above the sitter''s head. This somber space gives it some power and takes the image into another realm then just a portrait.', '2016-03-07 09:24:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7441672, 1176696, 156466, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comment, Mary Ann.  This was in my top 2.  It was everything I thought a Window Light image should be, not to mention it immediately called to mind my grandmother who I grew up with. From the hands to the measuring cup it was a flashback to childhood watching her bake in her kitchen.  How this stayed out of the top 10 I''ll never know.</td>', 'Thanks for the comment, Mary Ann.  This was in my top 2.  It was everything I thought a Window Light image should be, not to mention it immediately called to mind my grandmother who I grew up with. From the hands to the measuring cup it was a flashback to childhood watching her bake in her kitchen.  How this stayed out of the top 10 I''ll never know.', '2016-03-07 09:28:06.000000', NULL, 0),
